"Windows is blocking the scan. Allow Fusebox in Windows Security under Firewall & network protection, then press Scan." = "Windows blokkeert de scan. Sta Fusebox toe in Windows-beveiliging onder Firewall- en netwerkbeveiliging en druk dan op Scan.";
"Yes: Windows and apps may hold back big downloads" = "Ja: Windows en apps houden grote downloads mogelijk tegen";
